    "created_at": "2017-08-22T14:51:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-08-22T14:51:13Z",
    "body": "It seems Edge throws an exception if there's leading whitespace in `setData`. With leading whitespace [removed](http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/5318), EdgeHTML gives\r\n```\r\nlog: true\r\nlog: false\r\nlog: true\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
