    "created_at": "2017-08-22T20:48:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-08-22T20:48:30Z",
    "body": "As confusing as it sounds, iOS WebKit behaves differently from macOS WebKit. On iOS, we always stripped leading & trailing whitespaces. Given that I suspect there could be mobile content out there that depends on this behavior.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
