    "created_at": "2017-08-23T07:15:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-08-23T07:15:49Z",
    "body": "FWIW, stripping whitespace around the MIME type seems reasonable to me. We'll also be doing that for data: URL MIME types. See https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/pull/579.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
